# TML is based on line segments separated with the following characters
#    # starts comments
#    ' starts description (markdown)
#    - defines attributes (basic values onlyS)
#    + defines references (roles in UML)
#    : defines an object
#    ~ introduces examples
#    ... indicates that the model element is to be completed
#    ??? indicates that something must be checked
#   

Class1
  < Subclass
  > Superclass
  ' description with a reference to _Class1 and _object
  ' markdown [link](https://example.org/target)
  ' image ![view](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df4e1749-5086-4b55-8462-4a58c82c5b00)
  : object
  - attribute1: DataType[0..1] ~ example ' description
  + reference1: Class1[*]{ordered} opposite of roleÉ
